@startuml
actor Chef
boundary "Halaman Dapur (Blade)" as UI
control "JavaScript (Fetch API)" as JS
control "Recipe Controller (Laravel)" as BE
database "Database (MySQL)" as DB

Chef -> UI : Klik Kartu Resep (cth: Baguette)
activate UI

UI -> JS : bukaResep(id)
activate JS
JS -> BE : GET /api/recipes/{id}
BE -> DB : Query detail resep & komposisi
DB --> BE : Data Resep & Bahan
BE --> JS : JSON Data
JS --> UI : Tampilkan Modal Detail & Bahan
deactivate JS

Chef -> UI : Klik "Mulai Produksi"
activate JS

JS -> BE : POST /api/recipes/{id}/execute\n[Body: portions]
activate BE

BE -> DB : Start Transaction: Kurangi stok semua bahan terkait
activate DB
DB --> BE : Commit Transaction (Success)
deactivate DB

BE --> JS : Return JSON (success: true, message)
deactivate BE

JS -> UI : tutupResep()
JS -> UI : tampilToast('success', message)
UI --> Chef : Muncul Toast OREN Sukses

JS -> JS : window.location.reload() (Jeda 1.5 detik)
deactivate JS
UI --> Chef : Halaman Refresh (Stok Terupdate)
deactivate UI
@enduml